OL,3,GNEWSA'My legs buckled when I opened my
OL,4,Aexam results during Covid'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student whose exam results were
OL,7,Fdowngraded during Covid says she still
OL,8,Fwants answers from education bosses
OL,9,Fafter their decisions changed the
OL,10,Ftrajectory of her life.
OL,12,FErin Bleakley's plans were ruined after
OL,13,Fshe was awarded Bs, Cs and Ds in her
OL,14,Fhighers in 2020 after an emergency
OL,15,Fmarking system was introduced.
OL,17,FDespite her results being eventually
OL,18,Fadjusted, she never got the A grades
OL,19,Fher prelims suggested she would get and
OL,20,Fshe had to change course.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
